# =====================================================================
# Experiment outputs — fail-safe deny-list.
#
# Everything under outputs/ is private by default, so a new experiment
# never leaks patient-level rows by accident. Only tables that are
# aggregate (metrics, counts) may be whitelisted below; anything with a
# note_id, subject_id, hadm_id, or report text must NOT be.
# =====================================================================
paper/reproduce/outputs/*
!paper/reproduce/outputs/e00_reproduce_table.csv
!paper/reproduce/outputs/e00_robustness.csv
!paper/reproduce/outputs/e02_cv_results.csv
!paper/reproduce/outputs/e09_*.csv

# =====================================================================
# Paper drafts — kept local until the team decides to publish them.
# Code and project documentation under paper/ ARE tracked (see below).
# =====================================================================
paper/*.tex
paper/*.pdf
paper/*.png
paper/ml4h_signal2scan_draft.md
paper/*.aux
paper/*.log
paper/*.out
paper/*.fls
paper/*.fdb_latexmk

